{"evidence_id":"EVIDENCE-AUTH-003-1790561259441","evidence_request_id":"EVID-AUTH-003-V1-1790561117303","case_run_id":"AUTH-003","submission_version":1,"evidence_type":"AUTHORITY_CLARIFICATION","evidence_source":"CHAT_TEXT","file_name":"","mime_type":"text/plain","storage_url":"","evidence_text":"Authority clarification for AUTH-003

Bluegum Vector Demo Pty Ltd, business identifier AU-DEMO-BIZ-1002, authorises Liam Chen to act on behalf of the company for telecommunications-related activities.

The authorised scope explicitly includes:

ordering new telecommunications services;
approving commercial commitments associated with those services;
requesting and approving service or plan changes; and
executing and signing telecommunications service agreements on behalf of Bluegum Vector Demo Pty Ltd.

This authority applies to the current authorised-representative request and remains valid for the period covered by the submitted authority documentation.","structured_data_json":"{"originating_check_type":"AUTHORITY_VALIDATION"}","validation_status":"RECEIVED","confidence":0,"provided_at":"2026-09-28T02:07:39.441Z","superseded":false}

